facilities.quote:
Services Covered

This Policy covers technical and facility fees for emergency and other medically necessary care provided at the following
Cottage Health hospital and hospital-based facilities:

• Santa Barbara Cottage Hospital;
• Santa Ynez Valley Cottage Hospital;
• Goleta Valley Cottage Hospital;
and
• Hospital-Based Clinics
